1
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:17,600
Your father's cancer cells

2
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:19,760
have spread to the nearby lymph nodes.

3
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:21,400
It's currently at stage three.

4
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,920
What does stage three mean?

5
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,000
Is it serious?

6
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,360
You could say it's very serious.

7
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,360
But there's good news.

8
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,480
It hasn't metastasized yet.

9
00:03:30,160 --> 00:03:30,920
Then...

10
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:32,760
How much longer does he have?

11
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:34,720
Normally, one to five years.

12
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:37,120
But with active treatment,

13
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:39,400
many people can live with the tumor.

14
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:44,440
Doctor,

15
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,000
I'm begging you.

16
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,240
Whatever it takes,

17
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:49,520
please, you absolutely have to save my dad.

18
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:54,360
Right now, standard treatment is chemo and radiation.

19
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:57,160
We'll do four to six cycles first,

20
00:03:57,760 --> 00:04:00,200
then evaluate the results

21
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:02,560
to see if additional treatments are needed.

22
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:04,280
The patient's willpower is very important.

23
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:07,360
You need to keep him happy and cheerful.

24
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:11,800
Hear that?

25
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:14,080
The doctor said there's still a chance.

26
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,440
You have to believe in Uncle Chen.

27
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:21,560
Dad!

28
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,760
You have to hold on!

29
00:04:22,760 --> 00:04:23,520
Dad!

30
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:24,720
Dad!

31
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:25,680
Hold on!

32
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:26,920
Hurry! Dad!

33
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:27,920
Dad!

34
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:29,120
Hang in there, Dad!

35
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:30,800
Dad!

36
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:35,360
We're almost there! Almost there!

37
00:04:35,520 --> 00:04:36,440
Just hold on a little longer!

38
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:37,720
We're almost there!

39
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:11,400
Where's my dad?

40
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:14,880
Doctor.

41
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:15,640
Could I ask you something?

42
00:05:15,640 --> 00:05:17,400
Have you seen a man,

43
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,600
about this tall,

44
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:20,320
wearing a blue sweater?

45
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:21,720
An old man with a cane?

46
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,240
No, I haven't.

47
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:34,840
Sorry,

48
00:05:34,840 --> 00:05:37,920
the number you have dialed is not answering.

49
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,360
Please try again later.

50
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:39,920
Where's my dad?

51
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:40,680
I can't find him.

52
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:42,880
Where's Dad?

53
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,560
He's not answering.

54
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:46,840
Do you think Dad might've...

55
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:47,640
No.

56
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:49,760
Don't think like that.

57
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:52,480
Listen, you guys search over there.

58
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:52,960
I'll search over here.

59
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:53,520
Okay, okay.

60
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:54,160
Let's go.

61
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:15,840
Thank you for watching my kid, sir.

62
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:16,640
Thank you. Thank you.

63
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:17,320
No problem.

64
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:17,760
Thanks.

65
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:38,560
Work hard.

66
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:46,000
Let's go home.

67
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:56,600
I used to tell you to smoke less.

68
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,080
Now you know.

69
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:01,240
I know.

70
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:18,720
You're back!

71
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,280
I made some chicken soup just for you today.

72
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,640
It's already on the table.

73
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:24,160
I specifically bought a free-range chicken.

74
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:24,720
It's super tender.

75
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:27,680
And I made Dad his favorite steamed pork ribs.

76
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:28,920
Here.

77
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,240
The last dish is ready too.

78
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:35,720
Dad.

79
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:36,840
You came back by yourself?

80
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,920
Where are Xiaofang and her brother?

81
00:08:37,920 --> 00:08:40,120
They'll be right back.

82
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:40,800
Today, I

83
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:42,040
bought a nice bottle of liquor.

84
00:08:42,040 --> 00:08:43,200
Since they aren't back yet,

85
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,360
let's have a drink together first.

86
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:46,960
Alright.

87
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:47,920
I'll go get it right now.

88
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:54,560
Here.

89
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:56,640
For you, Dad.

90
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:02,560
Sip it slowly.

91
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:04,720
Here.

92
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,560
Drinking on an empty stomach is bad for you.

93
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,720
You need some food to go with your drink.

94
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:14,400
Here, have your favorite steamed pork.

95
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:17,000
You rascal.

96
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,720
You sure know how to butter me up.

97
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:23,400
When I first met you,

98
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,080
in my heart,

99
00:09:26,880 --> 00:09:28,200
I was actually worried.

100
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:32,480
My Xiaofang got herself a boyfriend

101
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:33,560
who looked

102
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:36,120
so completely unreliable.

103
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:39,520
Dad.

104
00:09:39,520 --> 00:09:41,280
To be honest with you,

105
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:44,480
I really was a bit unreliable before.

106
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,120
But don't worry.

107
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:49,080
I'm not the same as I used to be.

108
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:51,760
These past two years,

109
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:56,280
seeing how you are with Xiaofang,

110
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:58,720
I've taken it all to heart.

111
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:01,080
Our Xiaofang,

112
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:05,920
she has a sharp tongue but a soft heart.

113
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:11,120
Since you're so tolerant and protective of her,

114
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,560
my heart

115
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:17,000
is finally at ease.

116
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,640
Actually, to be honest,

117
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,200
I've always felt

118
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:22,200
that I don't have much to offer.

119
00:10:23,200 --> 00:10:24,600
But Xiaofang is different.

120
00:10:24,880 --> 00:10:26,840
She is very responsible.

121
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,320
I just hope that in the future,

122
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:30,360
whenever she's carrying a burden on her own,

123
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:32,120
I can share some of it for her.

124
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:34,840
Come on.

125
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:36,640
Let me toast you.

126
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:38,640
Come on.

127
00:10:38,920 --> 00:10:39,720
Alright.

128
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:40,960
You guys are back!

129
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,840
Go get two glasses,

130
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,640
let's all have a drink together.

131
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:43,480
Smells great.

132
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,360
Yeah.

133
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:47,200
Dad,

134
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:47,880
the doctor said

135
00:10:47,880 --> 00:10:49,040
you're not allowed to drink.

136
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:51,520
Not allowed to drink?

137
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:54,080
Dad was diagnosed with cancer.

138
00:10:59,000 --> 00:10:59,800
What?

139
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:07,400
Dad...

140
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,040
It's okay.

141
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:14,800
I won't be kicking the bucket just yet.

142
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:20,360
Dad, where are you going?

143
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:29,000
See this?

144
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:31,640
November 16th.

145
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:34,680
The 8th day of the 10th lunar month.

146
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,680
Auspicious for weddings.

147
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:38,560
A very lucky day.

148
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:41,120
A match made in heaven.

149
00:11:48,920 --> 00:11:50,800
This is the perfect day.

150
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:55,400
You two should have your wedding then!

151
00:11:57,520 --> 00:11:58,520
You got it, Dad.

152
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:03,800
Why are you guys just standing there?

153
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:07,800
Let's eat!

154
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,600
Smells so good.

155
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:15,320
Your cooking skills are getting better and better.

156
00:12:15,320 --> 00:12:16,040
Thanks, Dad.

157
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,320
Zhou Fang,

158
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,960
I'll have a drink with you.

159
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:20,000
Okay.

160
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:27,680
Here.

161
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:28,480
Dad.

162
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:29,760
A toast to you.

163
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:33,280
Alright.

164
00:12:33,280 --> 00:12:34,080
Good, good.

165
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:44,840
This is just wonderful.

166
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:24,960
You scared the hell out of me.

167
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:26,880
What are you blowing up all these balloons for?

168
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:29,200
Did you take a group order?

169
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:30,920
What group order?

170
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:32,640
You really think everything I do is for money.

171
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:34,040
That I'm just greedy.

172
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:36,000
I'm going to surprise them.

173
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:38,400
Then blow them up at the venue.

174
00:13:38,400 --> 00:13:40,080
You blew up so many, how will you get them there?

175
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:42,600
You're worrying over nothing.

176
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:43,920
See this?

177
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:45,560
I took all these balloons

178
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:47,480
and strung them all together.

179
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,240
Besides,

180
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,800
I've got my convertible, don't I?

181
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:53,720
Firing a salute to welcome the guests.

182
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,320
It's a good omen.

183
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:57,720
Hurry up, wash your face and brush your teeth.

184
00:13:57,720 --> 00:13:58,920
You look like a maniac.

185
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:00,440
I was just about to.

186
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:01,480
Geez.

187
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,720
They really are hard to carry.

188
00:14:32,560 --> 00:14:33,680
My boss,

189
00:14:33,680 --> 00:14:35,320
you're finally getting married today.

190
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:37,800
You have to be happy forever.

191
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:43,680
I will.

192
00:14:45,240 --> 00:14:48,040
One, two, three.

193
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:50,840
It worked!

194
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:52,400
Great job, Yangyang.

195
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:53,520
Later, when the bride comes out,

196
00:14:53,520 --> 00:14:54,600
you pop it just like this, okay?

197
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,080
Okay.

198
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:55,600
Good.

199
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:57,000
Were you scared, Yangyang?

200
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:57,960
No.

201
00:14:57,960 --> 00:14:58,960
I wanna do it again.

202
00:14:58,960 --> 00:14:59,960
You wanna do another one?

203
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:00,840
I wanna do it again.

204
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,200
Alright, one more.

205
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:03,240
Uncle Daren.

206
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:04,840
You look really sharp today.

207
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:06,200
On such an important day,

208
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:07,160
of course I do.

209
00:15:08,160 --> 00:15:08,960
How do I look?

210
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:10,720
Button your top button.

211
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:12,880
Alright, alright.

212
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:14,800
Take a picture of me.

213
00:15:14,800 --> 00:15:15,560
Sure.

214
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:17,040
Ready.

215
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:20,000
One, two, three.

216
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:52,720
Yueru...

217
00:15:54,920 --> 00:15:58,560
When you left, you told me

218
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:04,560
to raise the kids well

219
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:08,920
and keep them happy.

220
00:16:08,920 --> 00:16:10,400
When they grew up,

221
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:12,720
to see them settle down.

222
00:16:13,880 --> 00:16:15,960
I promised you I would.

223
00:16:21,680 --> 00:16:22,480
Today,

224
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:25,240
Xiaofang

225
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:29,840
got married.

226
00:16:34,520 --> 00:16:37,800
I've vetted this young man.

227
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:41,680
He's incredibly good to Xiaofang.

228
00:16:43,280 --> 00:16:45,640
So you can rest easy.

229
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:53,200
I never expected

230
00:16:53,560 --> 00:16:57,240
time to pass so quickly.

231
00:17:00,920 --> 00:17:03,480
That tiny little baby from back then

232
00:17:05,280 --> 00:17:08,240
has grown into a young woman.

233
00:17:08,720 --> 00:17:10,880
I just didn't expect

234
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:14,040
that in the blink of an eye,

235
00:17:14,920 --> 00:17:17,440
we'd be the ones listening to them.

236
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:29,480
Today

237
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:32,800
is truly a great day.

238
00:17:34,480 --> 00:17:36,920
I chose it for them.

239
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:43,000
An auspicious day.

240
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,840
A match made in heaven.

241
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,720
It's a shame

242
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:50,560
you won't get to see it.

243
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:58,960
Who's crying?

244
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:03,560
These are tears of joy.

245
00:18:11,600 --> 00:18:13,240
Let's go.

246
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:15,120
Let's go take a look.

247
00:18:15,960 --> 00:18:17,720
It's so lively.

248
00:18:28,360 --> 00:18:29,880
Hop on, then.

249
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,080
Let me scan you.

250
00:18:44,080 --> 00:18:45,600
Here, here.

251
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:48,320
Let me scan you.

252
00:18:48,320 --> 00:18:50,040
All three of you wear glasses.

253
00:18:50,040 --> 00:18:52,320
You three should add each other on WeChat.

254
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:53,160
How old are you?

255
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:53,800
Me?

256
00:18:54,760 --> 00:18:55,800
Sister Lan.

257
00:18:56,040 --> 00:18:57,320
You're definitely not married.

258
00:18:57,320 --> 00:18:58,040
Sister Lan!

259
00:18:58,840 --> 00:18:59,480
Hurry up.

260
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:01,000
Yangyang is calling you.

261
00:19:01,800 --> 00:19:02,840
Coming, coming.

262
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:05,080
You... you three go have a chat.

263
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:06,200
Go on, go have a drink.

264
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:07,320
Go grab a drink over there.

265
00:19:07,520 --> 00:19:08,880
Yangyang's been calling you for ages.

266
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:11,520
Sweetie, I didn't hear you just now.

267
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:12,400
Godmom was busy.

268
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:14,280
I found a potential client, you know?

269
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:16,000
Oh, give it a rest.

270
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:18,760
Don't tell me you monopolized all matchmaking in town.

271
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:25,120
You have no idea.

272
00:19:25,120 --> 00:19:27,360
My sense of smell is very sharp right now.

273
00:19:27,360 --> 00:19:28,720
As soon as I take a sniff,

274
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:31,040
I immediately know who's single.

275
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:33,400
Single people always...

276
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:37,680
...give off a faint scent of absolute loneliness.

277
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:39,520
Then tell me, who's single here?

278
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:41,360
You, of course.

279
00:19:41,760 --> 00:19:42,720
And you.

280
00:19:44,040 --> 00:19:46,240
I think there's something going on between you two.

281
00:19:47,360 --> 00:19:48,480
What are you laughing at?

282
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:51,720
Look at how happy she is.

283
00:19:51,720 --> 00:19:53,080
We won't hide it anymore.

284
00:19:53,320 --> 00:19:54,400
Show it to them.

285
00:19:54,520 --> 00:19:55,960
Blind them with it.

286
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:57,600
Show what?

287
00:19:59,640 --> 00:20:01,360
Oh my god.

288
00:20:01,360 --> 00:20:03,200
A marriage certificate!

289
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:04,760
Wang Daren!

290
00:20:04,760 --> 00:20:06,760
Wang Daren, come here and give me a hug right now!

291
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:08,080
Coming, coming!

292
00:20:08,080 --> 00:20:09,680
Wang Daren, I can't take this anymore.

293
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:10,400
Give me a hug, quick!

294
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:11,880
Yes, yes, yes. Let's hug, let's hug.

295
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:13,960
Dating without the goal of marriage...

296
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:15,200
...is just messing around, isn't it?

297
00:20:15,200 --> 00:20:16,040
Then your wedding...

298
00:20:16,040 --> 00:20:17,840
...must be hosted by Xidongdong!

299
00:20:19,120 --> 00:20:19,920
Bottoms up!

300
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:20,560
Great!

301
00:20:20,560 --> 00:20:21,640
Leave it to Xidongdong.

302
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:22,720
Come on, come on.

303
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:25,320
Then you have to give us a discount.

304
00:20:26,240 --> 00:20:27,320
A discount!

305
00:20:28,800 --> 00:20:29,680
You two...

306
00:20:29,680 --> 00:20:31,080
...should do a cross-arm toast!

307
00:20:31,800 --> 00:20:32,880
No way!

308
00:20:33,320 --> 00:20:34,440
Hurry up!

309
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:35,840
I really want to see it!

310
00:20:36,320 --> 00:20:38,360
This PDA you're feeding me...

311
00:20:38,360 --> 00:20:40,720
...is absolutely delicious!

312
00:20:53,920 --> 00:20:54,760
Mr. Zhou.

313
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:56,360
The ceremony is about to start.

314
00:20:56,840 --> 00:20:58,200
You need to get ready to go on stage.

315
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:21,280
Dad.

316
00:21:21,640 --> 00:21:25,760
I... I thought you weren't coming.

317
00:21:26,120 --> 00:21:28,160
It's my son's big day.

318
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:29,880
How could I not come?

319
00:21:33,600 --> 00:21:34,800
Dad.

320
00:21:36,760 --> 00:21:37,880
I'm sorry.

321
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,720
I was wrong to upset you before.

322
00:21:43,320 --> 00:21:44,480
The one who should be sorry...

323
00:21:45,200 --> 00:21:46,200
...is me.

324
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:49,280
For so many years,

325
00:21:50,040 --> 00:21:51,560
because I was busy,

326
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:54,760
I missed so much of your growing up.

327
00:21:55,120 --> 00:21:56,920
Instead, I always demanded

328
00:21:57,720 --> 00:21:59,480
that you achieve so-called success.

329
00:22:03,280 --> 00:22:05,280
Along the way,

330
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:06,960
you stumbled and struggled.

331
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:10,880
But I also saw your persistence,

332
00:22:10,880 --> 00:22:12,360
and how hard it was.

333
00:22:13,160 --> 00:22:15,440
You can support yourself now.

334
00:22:16,520 --> 00:22:17,640
Xiaofang

335
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:20,360
deserves half the credit for that, I guess.

336
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:28,520
But to be honest, Dad,

337
00:22:29,560 --> 00:22:30,880
I don't even know

338
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:32,360
if I'm ready or not.

339
00:22:33,200 --> 00:22:34,760
All I know is

340
00:22:35,720 --> 00:22:37,600
I really want to marry Xiaofang.

341
00:22:38,240 --> 00:22:39,240
I can tell.

342
00:22:40,200 --> 00:22:43,040
Xiaofang really wants what's best for you.

343
00:22:44,160 --> 00:22:45,480
After you get married,

344
00:22:46,080 --> 00:22:48,240
you'll definitely become

345
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:49,320
better versions of yourselves.

346
00:22:56,800 --> 00:22:58,040
This money...

347
00:22:59,360 --> 00:23:01,560
you can't give it back this time.

348
00:23:03,640 --> 00:23:05,520
As your father,

349
00:23:05,520 --> 00:23:07,120
this is my blessing to you.

350
00:23:08,600 --> 00:23:10,080
Well, my dad's blessing...

351
00:23:12,240 --> 00:23:13,800
I definitely have to accept.

352
00:23:13,800 --> 00:23:14,720
Thanks, Dad.

353
00:23:17,120 --> 00:23:18,760
Silly boy.

354
00:23:19,120 --> 00:23:19,960
You've grown up.

355
00:23:24,600 --> 00:23:26,720
Today is your big day.

356
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:28,120
You should be happy.

357
00:23:29,280 --> 00:23:30,840
Your beautiful bride

358
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:32,400
is still waiting for you.

359
00:23:32,920 --> 00:23:33,440
Go on.

360
00:23:33,720 --> 00:23:34,200
Let's go.

361
00:23:39,400 --> 00:23:42,800
Your Aunt Juan did this for me.

362
00:23:43,240 --> 00:23:44,320
Doesn't it make me look

363
00:23:44,840 --> 00:23:46,360
ten years younger?

364
00:23:46,560 --> 00:23:48,440
My dad is the most handsome!

365
00:23:52,520 --> 00:23:53,680
Xiaofang,

366
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:55,000
Dad

367
00:23:55,920 --> 00:23:58,920
can only walk you this far today.

368
00:23:59,680 --> 00:24:01,160
For the days ahead,

369
00:24:01,960 --> 00:24:03,600
you'll have to walk on your own.

370
00:24:04,280 --> 00:24:05,720
But you must remember,

371
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:07,240
Dad

372
00:24:07,520 --> 00:24:10,080
will always have your back.

373
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:14,640
I'll always support you.

374
00:24:15,760 --> 00:24:16,760
And now,

375
00:24:16,760 --> 00:24:19,200
please welcome our most beautiful bride

376
00:24:19,200 --> 00:24:20,520
to make her entrance!

377
00:25:26,240 --> 00:25:27,760
Go on.

378
00:25:28,440 --> 00:25:30,280
Go and bravely pursue

379
00:25:30,720 --> 00:25:33,040
your own happiness.

380
00:26:03,720 --> 00:26:04,760
Now,

381
00:26:04,760 --> 00:26:07,520
will the bride and groom please exchange rings.

382
00:26:35,880 --> 00:26:38,360
Finally, the moment we've all been waiting for!

383
00:26:38,720 --> 00:26:39,920
Now, it's time for the bride

384
00:26:39,920 --> 00:26:43,040
to toss her bouquet!

385
00:26:45,120 --> 00:26:46,840
Go on, go! Stand in the middle!

386
00:26:47,280 --> 00:26:48,800
Hurry, hurry! Come on, everyone!

387
00:26:52,360 --> 00:26:53,360
Come on, come on!

388
00:26:55,640 --> 00:26:58,160
One, two, three!

389
00:27:01,880 --> 00:27:03,520
Okay, for real this time!

390
00:27:04,120 --> 00:27:06,280
One, two, three!

391
00:27:21,560 --> 00:27:23,320
Kiss! Kiss!

392
00:27:23,320 --> 00:27:24,880
Kiss! Kiss!

393
00:27:24,880 --> 00:27:26,920
Kiss! Kiss!

394
00:27:26,920 --> 00:27:27,680
Kiss!

395
00:27:27,680 --> 00:27:32,720
Kiss! Kiss!

396
00:27:32,720 --> 00:27:34,680
Kiss! Kiss!

397
00:27:34,680 --> 00:27:37,000
Kiss! Kiss!

398
00:27:39,000 --> 00:27:40,400
What's wrong with you, kid?

399
00:27:40,720 --> 00:27:41,880
You're such a slowpoke!

400
00:27:41,880 --> 00:27:42,480
Hurry up! Hurry up!

401
00:27:42,480 --> 00:27:43,440
I really can't stand you!

402
00:27:43,440 --> 00:27:44,040
Hurry up!

403
00:27:49,120 --> 00:27:49,840
Yiran!

404
00:28:09,800 --> 00:28:11,480
I actually have a lot I want to tell you,

405
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:15,800
but every time I try to say it,

406
00:28:16,520 --> 00:28:17,760
I chicken out.

407
00:28:17,760 --> 00:28:19,120
And then I feel the timing isn't right.

408
00:28:22,280 --> 00:28:23,360
Look at the two of us.

409
00:28:23,360 --> 00:28:24,680
Since we graduated high school,

410
00:28:24,680 --> 00:28:26,920
we've been like two parallel lines.

411
00:28:27,560 --> 00:28:29,080
One went to Beijing,

412
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:30,800
and the other to Shanghai.

413
00:28:31,480 --> 00:28:32,680
I thought

414
00:28:33,600 --> 00:28:35,320
our paths would never cross again.

415
00:28:35,560 --> 00:28:36,920
But I didn't expect

416
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:38,240
fate to come full circle,

417
00:28:38,240 --> 00:28:39,600
and bring us both back to our hometown.

418
00:28:40,640 --> 00:28:44,120
From Pet Paradise's collapse and the debts

419
00:28:44,120 --> 00:28:46,720
to working together at Xiaoxitian,

420
00:28:46,720 --> 00:28:49,280
we've really been through so much.

421
00:28:49,280 --> 00:28:50,440
Yeah, so much.

422
00:28:57,600 --> 00:28:59,320
Do you remember Grandma Xiufang?

423
00:29:02,200 --> 00:29:04,240
At that time, you told me

424
00:29:04,240 --> 00:29:05,520
what it means to be an actor.

425
00:29:05,520 --> 00:29:06,720
The art of acting lies in

426
00:29:06,720 --> 00:29:08,720
interpreting another person's life.

427
00:29:09,120 --> 00:29:10,040
For an actor,

428
00:29:10,040 --> 00:29:12,640
isn't that the most joyful and meaningful thing?

429
00:29:13,440 --> 00:29:15,040
Here.

430
00:29:19,120 --> 00:29:20,520
Tastes good?

431
00:29:20,520 --> 00:29:22,000
It's good.

432
00:29:22,800 --> 00:29:25,560
It gave me the courage in that moment

433
00:29:25,560 --> 00:29:27,040
to use Xizi's identity

434
00:29:27,040 --> 00:29:29,720
and accompany Grandma Xiufang on her final journey.

435
00:29:31,760 --> 00:29:32,680
At that time,

436
00:29:34,200 --> 00:29:38,240
I thought on the surface, you fought the whole world,

437
00:29:38,440 --> 00:29:39,680
tougher than rock.

438
00:29:39,680 --> 00:29:40,840
But in my eyes,

439
00:29:42,080 --> 00:29:45,200
your heart is softer than anyone's.

440
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:47,280
You know better than anyone

441
00:29:48,440 --> 00:29:49,440
how to live.

442
00:29:55,840 --> 00:29:58,040
The word "regret,"

443
00:29:58,240 --> 00:29:59,680
in our line of work,

444
00:30:00,080 --> 00:30:01,960
we know how heavy it is.

445
00:30:04,160 --> 00:30:05,200
Yeah, regret.

446
00:30:08,840 --> 00:30:10,200
Regret.

447
00:30:16,320 --> 00:30:17,680
I, I, I... Why am I talking about this?

448
00:30:17,680 --> 00:30:19,240
I... I actually wanted to say...

449
00:30:19,240 --> 00:30:20,120
What... what did I want to say?

450
00:30:20,120 --> 00:30:21,600
I... I wanted to say...

451
00:30:25,080 --> 00:30:25,920
What I actually wanted to say is...

452
00:30:25,920 --> 00:30:26,960
when... when I first saw you,

453
00:30:26,960 --> 00:30:28,480
I was really happy.

454
00:30:28,480 --> 00:30:31,360
Especially when you were... at the police station.

455
00:30:31,600 --> 00:30:33,640
And do you remember being in Wu Yuanfeng's office?

456
00:30:33,640 --> 00:30:35,720
You were slamming books all over the place.

457
00:30:35,720 --> 00:30:37,040
You scared that boss so much

458
00:30:37,040 --> 00:30:39,480
he yelled to kick that little girl out immediately.

459
00:30:39,480 --> 00:30:41,800
I felt like you melted everyone's hearts back then.

460
00:30:41,800 --> 00:30:43,440
Including mine.

461
00:30:43,440 --> 00:30:45,040
You melted mine, too.

462
00:31:03,360 --> 00:31:04,120
Li Yiran.

463
00:31:07,640 --> 00:31:08,560
I like you.

464
00:31:11,720 --> 00:31:13,040
Will you be with me?

465
00:31:17,720 --> 00:31:18,600
Chen Baixi.

466
00:31:19,600 --> 00:31:21,320
You're really rambling today.

467
00:32:03,760 --> 00:32:04,560
Dad.

468
00:32:04,560 --> 00:32:05,560
I bought you a gift.

469
00:32:09,360 --> 00:32:10,520
That's an improvement!

470
00:32:17,400 --> 00:32:18,560
Did you find anything?

471
00:32:20,040 --> 00:32:21,920
I know where Grandma Sun's last letter is.

472
00:32:21,920 --> 00:32:22,560
Let's go.

473
00:32:23,760 --> 00:32:24,400
So soon?

474
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:25,360
We're leaving, Uncle Chen.

475
00:32:25,760 --> 00:32:26,560
We're leaving, Dad.

476
00:32:27,720 --> 00:32:28,920
Where are you going?

477
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:31,360
We'll wait for you for dinner!

478
00:32:34,120 --> 00:32:35,560
Starting today,

479
00:32:35,560 --> 00:32:39,000
I, Chen Xiaofang, am officially shedding the slacker title!

480
00:32:39,600 --> 00:32:41,160
I'm going to work with Xiaofang

481
00:32:41,440 --> 00:32:43,880
to take Xidongdong and Xiaoxitian

482
00:32:44,440 --> 00:32:45,760
out of Lecang

483
00:32:45,760 --> 00:32:47,000
and onto the global stage!

484
00:32:48,360 --> 00:32:49,200
Yeah!

485
00:32:49,200 --> 00:32:50,560
Clap louder!

486
00:32:50,560 --> 00:32:51,560
What's the matter?

487
00:32:53,880 --> 00:32:55,840
So it seems that from now on, Xidongdong

488
00:32:55,840 --> 00:32:57,360
is going to rely entirely on me.

489
00:32:57,360 --> 00:32:58,720
Absolutely!

490
00:32:58,960 --> 00:33:00,840
Sister Lan is our anchor!

491
00:33:01,840 --> 00:33:02,640
What is this?

492
00:33:03,240 --> 00:33:04,600
Thousand-year-old ancient tree tea.

493
00:33:05,760 --> 00:33:06,840
And you only poured one cup?

494
00:33:06,840 --> 00:33:07,800
How thoughtless.

495
00:33:08,240 --> 00:33:08,920
Come on.

496
00:33:09,840 --> 00:33:11,360
To our two new students,

497
00:33:11,360 --> 00:33:13,280
here's to your academic success!

498
00:33:13,280 --> 00:33:13,840
Cheers!

499
00:33:14,240 --> 00:33:15,440
Thanks, Auntie Lan.

500
00:33:16,840 --> 00:33:18,160
Why are you drinking all by yourself?

501
00:33:18,160 --> 00:33:18,960
What about me?

502
00:33:21,760 --> 00:33:24,200
You're working at Uncle Daren's tonight.

503
00:33:24,200 --> 00:33:25,600
Be quick on your feet,

504
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:27,560
and mind your manners.

505
00:33:27,560 --> 00:33:28,360
Got it?

506
00:33:28,520 --> 00:33:29,680
Got it, Mom.

507
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:31,280
Go on.

508
00:33:35,160 --> 00:33:36,680
Yangyang is the best!

509
00:33:47,680 --> 00:33:48,720
Boss!

510
00:33:48,720 --> 00:33:49,800
Are our skewers ready yet?

511
00:33:49,800 --> 00:33:50,760
These are yours.

512
00:33:50,760 --> 00:33:51,840
I'll bring them right over.

513
00:33:53,600 --> 00:33:54,520
Hurry up.

514
00:33:54,520 --> 00:33:55,040
Go, quick.

515
00:33:55,400 --> 00:33:56,240
Alright, alright.

516
00:33:56,240 --> 00:33:57,440
Coming right up!

517
00:33:59,120 --> 00:34:00,000
Okay, thanks.

518
00:34:01,360 --> 00:34:02,400
No problem.

519
00:34:02,800 --> 00:34:03,640
Bring us a bottle of beer!

520
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:04,560
Sure, sure, sure.

521
00:34:05,040 --> 00:34:06,280
Do you have any? Yes.

522
00:34:06,880 --> 00:34:07,760
Are my skewers ready yet?

523
00:34:07,760 --> 00:34:08,560
The ones for that table.

524
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:10,280
Right away, right away!

525
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:13,760
Chives.

526
00:34:13,760 --> 00:34:14,360
Thanks.

527
00:34:18,240 --> 00:34:19,040
Yangyang.

528
00:34:41,960 --> 00:34:43,960
May your journey to paradise

529
00:34:44,640 --> 00:34:47,440
be free from earthly suffering.

530
00:34:47,720 --> 00:34:48,480
Sister Liu.

531
00:34:49,800 --> 00:34:50,600
Rest in peace.

532
00:35:08,080 --> 00:35:08,920
Want another drink?

533
00:35:09,600 --> 00:35:10,400
No, I'm good.

534
00:35:14,040 --> 00:35:15,360
You two...

535
00:35:15,880 --> 00:35:17,480
should just get back to your own things.

536
00:35:19,040 --> 00:35:20,600
Tell your sister

537
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:24,280
she doesn't need to come tonight.

538
00:35:25,120 --> 00:35:26,720
We aren't comfortable leaving you alone.

539
00:35:27,560 --> 00:35:28,640
I'll stay and keep you company.

540
00:35:30,920 --> 00:35:32,320
Xiaofang

541
00:35:33,120 --> 00:35:34,840
is married now.

542
00:35:36,640 --> 00:35:39,360
Are they doing alright?

543
00:35:40,560 --> 00:35:41,840
Yesterday at the shop,

544
00:35:42,680 --> 00:35:44,160
Xiaofang was practically walking on air.

545
00:35:45,280 --> 00:35:47,640
She said someone drives her to and from work now.

546
00:35:48,040 --> 00:35:50,280
And gets her a coat when it's cold.

547
00:35:50,280 --> 00:35:51,360
Really showing off their love.

548
00:35:57,440 --> 00:35:59,080
Your mother and I,

549
00:35:59,640 --> 00:36:00,840
back in the day,

550
00:36:02,640 --> 00:36:04,760
when we first got married,

551
00:36:06,160 --> 00:36:07,480
used to fight all the time.

552
00:36:08,960 --> 00:36:09,960
Sometimes,

553
00:36:11,080 --> 00:36:14,240
if the food was too salty or bland,

554
00:36:14,240 --> 00:36:15,680
we'd get into a big argument.

555
00:36:17,520 --> 00:36:18,600
I thought you two

556
00:36:19,560 --> 00:36:21,160
never even had a single fight.

557
00:36:21,440 --> 00:36:24,640
When living as a married couple,

558
00:36:25,760 --> 00:36:28,800
you're bound to bump heads.

559
00:36:29,360 --> 00:36:30,160
It's just that,

560
00:36:30,920 --> 00:36:32,280
after arguing so much,

561
00:36:32,680 --> 00:36:34,160
we finally figured out

562
00:36:34,640 --> 00:36:36,680
what should be said,

563
00:36:39,960 --> 00:36:41,760
and what shouldn't.

564
00:36:53,840 --> 00:36:57,240
Xiaofang has her own family now.

565
00:36:58,520 --> 00:36:59,840
While I'm still around,

566
00:37:01,840 --> 00:37:05,120
you and Yiran need to hurry up.

567
00:37:07,360 --> 00:37:09,800
You must be good to Yiran.

568
00:37:11,760 --> 00:37:14,840
And treat your mother-in-law well.

569
00:37:19,840 --> 00:37:20,640
Keep that in mind.

570
00:37:22,240 --> 00:37:23,760
You and your sister,

571
00:37:24,920 --> 00:37:26,600
don't worry about me.

572
00:37:27,440 --> 00:37:29,040
I'll be fine.

573
00:37:30,080 --> 00:37:31,320
Even if

574
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:33,320
the day actually comes

575
00:37:34,040 --> 00:37:35,440
when I pass away,

576
00:37:36,360 --> 00:37:37,400
just think of it as

577
00:37:38,120 --> 00:37:39,920
me going to see your mom.

578
00:37:45,560 --> 00:37:46,720
Your mom

579
00:37:48,000 --> 00:37:49,800
was always timid.

580
00:37:53,080 --> 00:37:54,800
She's been over there

581
00:37:57,640 --> 00:37:59,440
for so many years now.

582
00:38:02,520 --> 00:38:03,880
It's about time I go

583
00:38:05,520 --> 00:38:06,800
and keep her company.

584
00:38:34,760 --> 00:38:38,680
You're a grown man. What are you crying for?

585
00:38:41,120 --> 00:38:43,600
It's not like I'm passing on right away.

586
00:38:50,720 --> 00:38:52,040
Someday,

587
00:38:53,560 --> 00:38:55,040
our family

588
00:38:55,960 --> 00:38:58,120
will see each other again.

589
00:39:01,360 --> 00:39:02,760
Your mom and I

590
00:39:04,440 --> 00:39:06,480
are just heading to the other side

591
00:39:08,040 --> 00:39:09,480
to get our home

592
00:39:15,240 --> 00:39:16,840
set up first.

593
00:40:01,440 --> 00:40:02,160
How old was I here?

594
00:40:02,160 --> 00:40:03,040
About a year old?

595
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:04,120
One month.

596
00:40:04,360 --> 00:40:05,440
At one, you'd be this tall.

597
00:40:05,440 --> 00:40:06,840
You were already learning to walk.

598
00:40:06,840 --> 00:40:07,840
I don't remember.

599
00:40:09,080 --> 00:40:10,640
Look how silly you look.

600
00:40:11,120 --> 00:40:12,320
Whenever I said "take a picture,"

601
00:40:12,320 --> 00:40:13,440
you'd have a piece of candy in your mouth,

602
00:40:13,440 --> 00:40:14,960
and strike a pose right away.

603
00:40:17,720 --> 00:40:19,320
Do you remember this photo?

604
00:40:19,760 --> 00:40:21,040
This... I remember this.

605
00:40:21,040 --> 00:40:21,800
You made me pose like this.

606
00:40:21,800 --> 00:40:24,040
You said supermodels all posed like this.

607
00:40:24,040 --> 00:40:24,840
Either a headache,

608
00:40:24,840 --> 00:40:25,480
or a stomachache,

609
00:40:25,480 --> 00:40:25,840
or a backache.

610
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:26,840
This is the backache.

611
00:40:27,560 --> 00:40:28,320
This is the stomachache.

612
00:40:28,320 --> 00:40:29,640
This... this is the headache.

613
00:40:30,120 --> 00:40:31,320
You remember this one, right?

614
00:40:31,320 --> 00:40:32,280
Look.

615
00:40:32,280 --> 00:40:33,960
You got your ears pierced at ten.

616
00:40:34,280 --> 00:40:35,560
Just to look pretty.

617
00:40:35,560 --> 00:40:36,840
You were so tough.

618
00:40:36,840 --> 00:40:38,240
You didn't cry at all.

619
00:40:38,240 --> 00:40:39,440
It actually hurt a lot.

620
00:40:39,440 --> 00:40:40,520
Of course it hurt.

621
00:40:43,640 --> 00:40:44,760
Are you nervous?

622
00:40:46,040 --> 00:40:47,240
Nervous about what?

623
00:40:49,080 --> 00:40:51,920
Aren't you going to Chen Baixi's house for dinner tomorrow?

624
00:40:54,760 --> 00:40:55,560
It's just...

625
00:40:56,480 --> 00:40:58,280
it's just a casual dinner.

626
00:40:58,840 --> 00:41:00,040
Let's stop looking.

627
00:41:06,840 --> 00:41:07,920
A family heirloom.

628
00:41:12,440 --> 00:41:13,640
Know what this is?

629
00:41:13,880 --> 00:41:14,840
What is it?

630
00:41:18,880 --> 00:41:20,440
This is from the day I got married.

631
00:41:21,640 --> 00:41:23,520
The calendar page your grandma tore off.

632
00:41:28,560 --> 00:41:29,440
And this.

633
00:41:33,840 --> 00:41:35,440
This bracelet is so pretty.

634
00:41:36,440 --> 00:41:37,360
It must be expensive.

635
00:41:38,440 --> 00:41:39,760
No matter how expensive,

636
00:41:39,760 --> 00:41:40,840
I could never sell it.

637
00:41:42,040 --> 00:41:43,520
Even during the hardest times,

638
00:41:44,000 --> 00:41:45,440
I still kept it.

639
00:41:47,080 --> 00:41:50,240
Your grandma left this to me.

640
00:41:50,920 --> 00:41:52,520
Grandma gave it to you. I can't take it.

641
00:41:55,240 --> 00:41:56,720
Grandma left it to me,

642
00:41:56,720 --> 00:41:59,120
which means it's meant for you. Put it on.

643
00:42:08,720 --> 00:42:09,680
You have to remember,

644
00:42:10,960 --> 00:42:13,240
as long as Mom is here, you have a home.

645
00:42:14,640 --> 00:42:16,920
No matter what happens in the future,

646
00:42:17,240 --> 00:42:19,040
Mom will always have your back.

647
00:42:24,320 --> 00:42:25,920
I know, I know.

648
00:42:25,920 --> 00:42:27,160
Comrade Wu Huilan.

649
00:42:28,040 --> 00:42:29,040
Like hell you know.

650
00:42:29,480 --> 00:42:30,320
Silly girl.

651
00:42:31,680 --> 00:42:33,640
Many times, I forget

652
00:42:34,560 --> 00:42:37,720
that before Mom became a mother,

653
00:42:37,720 --> 00:42:38,840
she was also a daughter.

654
00:42:39,960 --> 00:42:42,560
Grandma gave all her love to Wu Huilan,

655
00:42:43,440 --> 00:42:44,480
and Wu Huilan

656
00:42:45,360 --> 00:42:47,200
gave all her love

657
00:42:47,920 --> 00:42:49,200
to me.

658
00:43:01,240 --> 00:43:02,120
Mom

659
00:43:07,120 --> 00:43:08,840
I can't bear to let you go.

660
00:43:19,040 --> 00:43:20,040
So silly.

661
00:43:20,040 --> 00:43:21,320
What the hell are you crying for?

662
00:43:21,320 --> 00:43:22,040
What's wrong with you?

663
00:43:22,040 --> 00:43:23,120
You're not coming back?

664
00:43:23,840 --> 00:43:24,720
Of course I'll be back.

665
00:43:27,640 --> 00:43:28,440
You're...

666
00:43:45,280 --> 00:43:46,400
Happy New Year!

667
00:43:48,480 --> 00:43:49,720
I was just about to say,

668
00:43:49,800 --> 00:43:51,560
that scarf looks really pretty on you.

669
00:43:51,560 --> 00:43:52,280
Of course.

670
00:43:52,280 --> 00:43:53,680
It depends on who bought it.

671
00:43:54,920 --> 00:43:56,360
Why are your palms so sweaty?

672
00:43:57,560 --> 00:43:59,920
Who wouldn't be nervous meeting their mother-in-law?

673
00:44:00,280 --> 00:44:01,320
What are you nervous about?

674
00:44:01,720 --> 00:44:03,240
Don't you see her all the time?

675
00:44:03,760 --> 00:44:04,760
That was before.

676
00:44:05,040 --> 00:44:06,360
I used to just call her Auntie Lan.

677
00:44:06,360 --> 00:44:07,160
It's different now.

678
00:44:08,440 --> 00:44:10,680
Then you'd better be on your best behavior later.

679
00:44:10,680 --> 00:44:11,760
Maybe as a reward for calling her "Mom",

680
00:44:11,760 --> 00:44:13,760
Wu Huilan will give you a big red envelope.

681
00:44:15,240 --> 00:44:17,520
Whatever the amount, I'll hand it all over to you.

682
00:44:18,800 --> 00:44:20,120
You really are an acting major.

683
00:44:20,120 --> 00:44:21,880
Your acting is totally superficial.

684
00:44:22,280 --> 00:44:24,960
But it still couldn't escape your sharp eyes.

685
00:44:32,280 --> 00:44:33,120
Happy New Year!

686
00:44:33,960 --> 00:44:35,520
Happy New Year!

687
00:45:32,600 --> 00:45:34,240
Li Yiran

688
00:45:34,840 --> 00:45:35,840
What are you looking at?

689
00:45:38,640 --> 00:45:39,760
An acquaintance.

690
00:45:42,960 --> 00:45:45,800
Let's go. Everyone's waiting for New Year's Eve dinner.

691
00:45:45,800 --> 00:45:46,520
Let's go.

692
00:45:50,080 --> 00:45:51,840
Alright, alright.

693
00:45:52,560 --> 00:45:54,640
The red envelopes are here.

694
00:45:54,640 --> 00:45:56,760
Okay, thanks.

695
00:45:57,560 --> 00:45:59,480
This red envelope is yours.

696
00:45:59,480 --> 00:46:00,480
Thanks, Dad. Thanks, Dad.

697
00:46:00,480 --> 00:46:01,680
Coming, coming.

698
00:46:01,680 --> 00:46:02,400
Time for dumplings.

699
00:46:02,400 --> 00:46:03,120
Coming.

700
00:46:04,160 --> 00:46:05,480
Dumplings are here.

701
00:46:05,480 --> 00:46:06,600
Thanks for your hard work, young Boss Zhou.

702
00:46:06,600 --> 00:46:08,120
May you have abundance every year.

703
00:46:09,040 --> 00:46:10,480
My dear in-law,

704
00:46:10,840 --> 00:46:12,920
this hotpot base you made

705
00:46:12,920 --> 00:46:14,800
is getting better and better.

706
00:46:14,800 --> 00:46:15,680
You bet it is.

707
00:46:15,680 --> 00:46:17,280
It's my specialty.

708
00:46:17,280 --> 00:46:18,920
You should eat more.

709
00:46:18,920 --> 00:46:19,560
Okay.

710
00:46:19,560 --> 00:46:20,760
We're late.

711
00:46:20,760 --> 00:46:22,480
Happy New Year!

712
00:46:23,360 --> 00:46:25,160
We've been looking forward to this,

713
00:46:25,160 --> 00:46:26,720
and you're finally here.

714
00:46:26,720 --> 00:46:27,360
Come, come.

715
00:46:27,360 --> 00:46:28,720
Quick, sit down.

716
00:46:30,360 --> 00:46:31,160
Okay.

717
00:46:31,800 --> 00:46:33,200
You silly boy.

718
00:46:33,880 --> 00:46:35,720
Where are the manners I taught you?

719
00:46:37,960 --> 00:46:38,680
What?

720
00:46:41,760 --> 00:46:42,560
Mom.

721
00:46:43,600 --> 00:46:44,640
That was too quiet.

722
00:46:44,640 --> 00:46:46,040
Nobody heard that, right?

723
00:46:46,040 --> 00:46:46,640
Didn't hear it.

724
00:46:46,640 --> 00:46:47,280
Louder.

725
00:46:50,200 --> 00:46:51,160
Mom!

726
00:46:51,960 --> 00:46:53,440
That's better, that's better.

727
00:46:54,200 --> 00:46:56,520
You, hurry up.

728
00:46:56,520 --> 00:46:57,400
Dad.

729
00:46:58,680 --> 00:46:59,880
Great, great.

730
00:46:59,880 --> 00:47:01,800
I've had the red envelope ready for a while.

731
00:47:01,800 --> 00:47:03,160
Thanks, Dad.

732
00:47:03,160 --> 00:47:04,320
Sister Lan, hurry and give him the red envelope.

733
00:47:04,320 --> 00:47:05,640
This is for you. We brought it for you.

734
00:47:06,000 --> 00:47:07,120
Thanks, Dad.

735
00:47:07,480 --> 00:47:08,200
Come on, come on.

736
00:47:08,200 --> 00:47:09,320
Give it to me. I'll help you hold it.

737
00:47:10,600 --> 00:47:11,360
Son-in-law.

738
00:47:11,360 --> 00:47:12,800
I can call you my son-in-law now, right?

739
00:47:12,800 --> 00:47:13,680
Of course.

740
00:47:13,680 --> 00:47:16,240
Here, a red envelope from Mom.

741
00:47:17,200 --> 00:47:19,520
From now on, we're family.

742
00:47:19,680 --> 00:47:21,480
You have to treat Yiran well.

743
00:47:21,480 --> 00:47:22,720
Otherwise, Mom will...

744
00:47:23,640 --> 00:47:24,440
Mom.

745
00:47:24,960 --> 00:47:25,680
Mom.

746
00:47:26,080 --> 00:47:26,960
Don't worry.

747
00:47:26,960 --> 00:47:28,520
I will treat her well for the rest of my life.

748
00:47:28,520 --> 00:47:30,280
I won't let her suffer the slightest wrong.

749
00:47:31,840 --> 00:47:32,760
That's more like it.

750
00:47:32,760 --> 00:47:33,880
I believe you.

751
00:47:33,880 --> 00:47:34,760
Sit.

752
00:47:36,720 --> 00:47:37,400
Quick, quick.

753
00:47:45,080 --> 00:47:46,360
Everyone is here.

754
00:47:46,360 --> 00:47:47,520
Let's have a drink together.

755
00:47:47,520 --> 00:47:48,240
Come, come.

756
00:47:48,240 --> 00:47:48,880
Cheers.

757
00:47:48,880 --> 00:47:49,560
Happy New Year!

758
00:47:49,560 --> 00:47:50,400
Happy New Year!

759
00:47:50,400 --> 00:47:51,520
Happy New Year!

760
00:47:57,640 --> 00:47:59,040
Come on, let's eat.

761
00:47:59,040 --> 00:47:59,640
Here.

762
00:48:01,280 --> 00:48:03,080
Dad, have some crispy pork.

763
00:48:04,760 --> 00:48:05,360
Yangyang.

764
00:48:06,600 --> 00:48:07,520
Let's add some meatballs.

765
00:48:07,520 --> 00:48:08,080
The meat ones, right?

766
00:48:08,080 --> 00:48:09,000
For a happy reunion.

767
00:48:12,200 --> 00:48:13,120
Let me, let me.

768
00:48:13,880 --> 00:48:14,880
I'll put the meatballs in.

769
00:48:19,000 --> 00:48:19,720
It's the New Year.

770
00:48:19,720 --> 00:48:21,280
Let's liven things up a bit.

771
00:48:21,760 --> 00:48:22,480
You two.

772
00:48:22,480 --> 00:48:23,560
Give each other a kiss.

773
00:48:24,920 --> 00:48:25,720
Right now?

774
00:48:26,520 --> 00:48:27,200
Kiss! Kiss!

775
00:48:27,200 --> 00:48:27,920
Kiss! Kiss!

776
00:48:27,920 --> 00:48:28,840
What's the big deal? Come on.

777
00:48:30,640 --> 00:48:31,440
One more!

778
00:48:34,280 --> 00:48:35,560
Did you even kiss on the lips?

779
00:48:36,400 --> 00:48:37,840
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss!

780
00:48:37,840 --> 00:48:40,400
Kiss! Kiss!

781
00:48:40,400 --> 00:48:42,080
Kiss! Kiss!

782
00:48:42,080 --> 00:48:43,480
Kiss! Kiss!

783
00:48:46,120 --> 00:48:47,640
You guys are making me blush.

784
00:48:48,520 --> 00:48:50,040
Come, Mom wants a kiss too.

785
00:48:54,720 --> 00:48:55,480
That's enough, right?

786
00:48:55,480 --> 00:48:56,520
Enough, enough.

787
00:48:56,520 --> 00:48:57,360
Amin.

788
00:48:57,360 --> 00:48:59,360
You're way too shy.

789
00:48:59,560 --> 00:49:00,320
Exactly.

790
00:49:01,120 --> 00:49:02,360
Juan, you make the first move.

791
00:49:02,880 --> 00:49:04,480
Let's kiss Yangyang together.

792
00:49:04,480 --> 00:49:04,880
Come on.

793
00:49:04,880 --> 00:49:06,200
That works, that works.

794
00:49:11,240 --> 00:49:11,880
In-law!

795
00:49:11,880 --> 00:49:13,040
You're so pitiful.

796
00:49:13,040 --> 00:49:14,480
No one's giving you a kiss.

797
00:49:16,720 --> 00:49:17,400
Let's...

798
00:49:17,400 --> 00:49:19,120
Let's all give Dad a kiss together.

799
00:49:22,680 --> 00:49:23,760
Happy New Year, Dad!

800
00:49:23,760 --> 00:49:24,720
Happy New Year!

801
00:49:26,520 --> 00:49:27,240
You all gave him a kiss!

802
00:49:27,240 --> 00:49:28,240
Wang Daren, you're on your own.

803
00:49:28,560 --> 00:49:29,640
I'll blow you a kiss.

804
00:49:31,360 --> 00:49:32,640
In-law,

805
00:49:32,640 --> 00:49:33,960
at this table,

806
00:49:33,960 --> 00:49:35,600
you must be the oldest here.

807
00:49:37,480 --> 00:49:39,000
So you should start us off.

808
00:49:39,000 --> 00:49:39,880
Say a blessing.

809
00:49:39,880 --> 00:49:40,680
Everyone says one.

810
00:49:40,680 --> 00:49:41,360
We'll go in a circle.

811
00:49:41,360 --> 00:49:42,160
Sound good?

812
00:49:42,160 --> 00:49:42,920
Yes, yes, yes!

813
00:49:42,920 --> 00:49:43,400
Sounds good! Sounds good!

814
00:49:43,400 --> 00:49:44,200
Come on, here we go.

815
00:49:44,560 --> 00:49:45,800
Alright, alright, alright.

816
00:49:48,520 --> 00:49:50,800
Then I'll toast with tea.

817
00:49:52,360 --> 00:49:54,720
Wishing all our old pals

818
00:49:54,720 --> 00:49:56,520
good health

819
00:49:57,560 --> 00:49:58,680
and a great appetite!

820
00:49:58,680 --> 00:49:59,200
Hear, hear!

821
00:49:59,200 --> 00:50:00,320
And to the young folks,

822
00:50:00,760 --> 00:50:02,320
stay forever young!

823
00:50:03,360 --> 00:50:04,720
Good, good, good!

824
00:50:05,600 --> 00:50:06,160
Nice!

825
00:50:07,560 --> 00:50:08,440
My turn!

826
00:50:09,360 --> 00:50:11,280
I'll say something practical.

827
00:50:11,280 --> 00:50:14,160
Wishing everyone bulging wallets!

828
00:50:14,160 --> 00:50:15,680
Make a fortune this New Year!

829
00:50:15,680 --> 00:50:16,360
That's great.

830
00:50:16,360 --> 00:50:16,960
Alright.

831
00:50:16,960 --> 00:50:19,000
Then I'll say something impractical.

832
00:50:19,000 --> 00:50:20,200
Wishing everyone

833
00:50:20,200 --> 00:50:21,160
abundant blessings

834
00:50:21,160 --> 00:50:22,280
and endless good luck!

835
00:50:22,280 --> 00:50:23,200
Come on, let's drink to that.

836
00:50:23,480 --> 00:50:24,320
Bottoms up.

837
00:50:24,320 --> 00:50:25,000
A lovers' toast!

838
00:50:25,000 --> 00:50:26,120
Alright!

839
00:50:27,800 --> 00:50:29,080
You might pop out a baby later!

840
00:50:29,400 --> 00:50:30,640
For our family,

841
00:50:30,640 --> 00:50:31,560
Lijuan will represent us.

842
00:50:31,560 --> 00:50:32,480
Don't make me represent us.

843
00:50:32,480 --> 00:50:32,960
You go first.

844
00:50:32,960 --> 00:50:34,040
Come on, stand up, stand up.

845
00:50:34,040 --> 00:50:35,360
Yangyang, stand up. Come on.

846
00:50:35,800 --> 00:50:37,080
I'll say it. Here I go.

847
00:50:39,360 --> 00:50:40,680
Wishing everyone, uh...

848
00:50:41,080 --> 00:50:43,080
A booming life full of joy,

849
00:50:43,080 --> 00:50:44,840
and growing wealth year by year!

850
00:50:45,440 --> 00:50:45,840
Nice!

851
00:50:45,840 --> 00:50:47,080
So cultured! Very poetic!

852
00:50:47,080 --> 00:50:48,520
Then I wish everyone

853
00:50:48,520 --> 00:50:50,120
gets more beautiful every year!

854
00:50:50,480 --> 00:50:50,960
Great!

855
00:50:50,960 --> 00:50:52,360
What about Yangyang? What about Yangyang?

856
00:50:52,680 --> 00:50:54,760
Happy New Year!

857
00:50:55,640 --> 00:50:56,920
Speaking a foreign language now!

858
00:50:57,120 --> 00:50:57,800
Come on.

859
00:51:01,160 --> 00:51:02,600
Daren, your turn to speak.

860
00:51:02,600 --> 00:51:03,040
Alright, alright.

861
00:51:03,040 --> 00:51:03,920
Uncle Daren.

862
00:51:03,920 --> 00:51:04,680
You guys are done.

863
00:51:04,680 --> 00:51:05,520
I have to say mine now.

864
00:51:06,440 --> 00:51:08,400
Wishing everyone's life is like this hotpot,

865
00:51:08,400 --> 00:51:10,120
booming and bustling!

866
00:51:10,680 --> 00:51:11,200
Great!

867
00:51:11,200 --> 00:51:12,400
Good, good, good!

868
00:51:12,400 --> 00:51:12,800
Then

869
00:51:12,920 --> 00:51:14,040
I'll drink to that with you.

870
00:51:14,040 --> 00:51:14,800
Sounds good!

871
00:51:15,440 --> 00:51:16,560
Sounds good! Sounds good!

872
00:51:18,760 --> 00:51:19,960
Then I wish everyone

873
00:51:21,160 --> 00:51:22,040
that everything goes your way.

874
00:51:22,040 --> 00:51:22,920
May your wishes come true.

875
00:51:23,600 --> 00:51:25,360
I wish everyone in the new year

876
00:51:25,360 --> 00:51:26,760
a life like fireworks,

877
00:51:26,760 --> 00:51:27,840
gorgeous and colorful!

878
00:51:27,840 --> 00:51:28,840
Nice!

879
00:51:30,720 --> 00:51:31,640
Thank you, sister-in-law.

880
00:51:31,640 --> 00:51:32,960
You're welcome, sis.

881
00:51:34,280 --> 00:51:36,360
New year, new vibes.

882
00:51:36,880 --> 00:51:38,320
May our Chunguang Alley

883
00:51:38,320 --> 00:51:39,560
become happier and happier.

884
00:51:40,200 --> 00:51:42,520
May life be as bright as spring every day!

885
00:51:42,520 --> 00:51:42,960
Hear, hear!

886
00:51:42,960 --> 00:51:43,640
Happy New Year!

887
00:51:43,640 --> 00:51:45,120
Happy New Year!

888
00:51:59,200 --> 00:52:00,480
So beautiful.

889
00:52:06,320 --> 00:52:08,320
Returning to my hometown from Shanghai,

890
00:52:08,320 --> 00:52:10,920
I thought it would just be a brief stay,

891
00:52:11,280 --> 00:52:15,560
but it turned out to be a long and gentle pause.

892
00:52:17,080 --> 00:52:18,440
I drew closer to death,

893
00:52:19,640 --> 00:52:20,280
No!

894
00:52:21,080 --> 00:52:22,400
and drew closer to life once again.

895
00:52:22,400 --> 00:52:24,320
Thank you. Thank you.

896
00:52:26,840 --> 00:52:30,280
Those departing figures, one after another, made me realize

897
00:52:32,000 --> 00:52:34,600
that saying goodbye is never the end.

898
00:52:37,320 --> 00:52:40,320
The love hidden in the little things of life

899
00:52:42,600 --> 00:52:44,840
Grandma will make it for you again tomorrow.

900
00:52:46,760 --> 00:52:47,720
Okay, okay.

901
00:52:48,560 --> 00:52:52,720
quietly becomes a footnote to our lives.

902
00:53:02,960 --> 00:53:04,360
Just take a sip.

903
00:53:04,920 --> 00:53:07,560
These seemingly trivial yet real daily moments

904
00:53:07,560 --> 00:53:09,120
remind us that

905
00:53:09,480 --> 00:53:10,760
life is a constant loss.

906
00:53:10,760 --> 00:53:11,920
Why is it you?

907
00:53:12,240 --> 00:53:13,320
Close your eyes, quick.

908
00:53:13,720 --> 00:53:15,600
But it's also a constant gain.

909
00:53:17,000 --> 00:53:20,160
Every parting is a promised reunion.

910
00:53:20,600 --> 00:53:22,160
Everything we lose

911
00:53:22,160 --> 00:53:25,440
will echo back in another form.

912
00:53:25,440 --> 00:53:29,760
Dad is the best in the world.

913
00:53:29,760 --> 00:53:31,720
Those hurdles we thought we couldn't cross,

914
00:53:31,720 --> 00:53:33,200
and wounds we thought would never heal,

915
00:53:33,920 --> 00:53:35,120
looking back,

916
00:53:35,360 --> 00:53:37,560
have all become scenery left behind.

917
00:53:37,560 --> 00:53:38,240
Dad.

918
00:53:39,160 --> 00:53:39,800
Dad.

919
00:53:39,800 --> 00:53:41,080
Whoever of you

920
00:53:41,080 --> 00:53:43,400
takes on this funeral today,

921
00:53:43,400 --> 00:53:45,840
I'll disown you!

922
00:53:45,840 --> 00:53:46,240
Wu Huilan!

923
00:53:46,240 --> 00:53:48,760
Those seemingly unbreakable barriers,

924
00:53:49,680 --> 00:53:51,560
just like winter snow,

925
00:53:52,000 --> 00:53:53,680
will eventually melt away.

926
00:53:54,280 --> 00:53:55,360
From now on,

927
00:53:55,680 --> 00:53:57,200
let's all just be ourselves.

928
00:53:57,560 --> 00:53:59,040
For the rest of our lives,

929
00:53:59,200 --> 00:54:01,360
we will still face pain,

930
00:54:01,640 --> 00:54:04,320
parting, and death.

931
00:54:04,560 --> 00:54:07,040
Some people are forever stuck in yesterday,

932
00:54:07,800 --> 00:54:09,680
while we, today,

933
00:54:09,680 --> 00:54:11,960
still have to run forward

934
00:54:11,960 --> 00:54:13,680
and welcome every sunrise.

935
00:54:14,320 --> 00:54:16,240
Even if reality is cruel,

936
00:54:16,240 --> 00:54:17,880
we must strive to grow upward.

937
00:54:17,880 --> 00:54:19,480
I'm not afraid of you!

938
00:54:23,240 --> 00:54:24,840
You work so hard studying.

939
00:54:24,840 --> 00:54:26,080
Don't touch me!

940
00:54:26,800 --> 00:54:28,920
Those seemingly futile efforts

941
00:54:30,400 --> 00:54:32,280
will eventually, at some corner,

942
00:54:32,280 --> 00:54:34,000
turn into unexpected surprises.

943
00:54:34,000 --> 00:54:34,960
Mom.

944
00:54:35,320 --> 00:54:36,520
I'm sorry.

945
00:54:41,080 --> 00:54:43,280
Those we thought we'd never see again

946
00:54:43,280 --> 00:54:46,520
are guarding you in another way,

947
00:54:47,120 --> 00:54:49,840
turning into starlight to light the way ahead,

948
00:54:49,840 --> 00:54:52,360
guiding us to the shores of happiness.

949
00:54:55,720 --> 00:54:57,840
And we will all be there,

950
00:54:59,640 --> 00:55:02,880
making peace with all our obsessions and regrets,

951
00:55:06,920 --> 00:55:08,720
heading toward a new life,

952
00:55:08,720 --> 00:55:10,400
in an endless cycle of life.

953
00:55:11,000 --> 00:55:11,920
Let's head back.

954
00:55:13,040 --> 00:55:14,120
You are...

955
00:55:18,880 --> 00:55:19,600
Let's take a photo!

956
00:55:19,600 --> 00:55:20,440
Boss Zhou,

957
00:55:20,440 --> 00:55:21,720
take a group photo for us.

958
00:55:21,720 --> 00:55:23,200
Come on!

959
00:55:24,920 --> 00:55:25,720
Come on!

960
00:55:26,080 --> 00:55:26,960
Everyone look there!

961
00:55:29,320 --> 00:55:30,960
Come on.

962
00:55:30,960 --> 00:55:33,760
Three, two, one.

963
00:55:33,760 --> 00:55:36,360
Happy New Year!

964
00:56:31,240 --> 00:56:32,400
Uncle Li.

965
00:56:33,800 --> 00:56:35,240
I've come to see you.

966
00:56:38,080 --> 00:56:39,760
Mom, who's this?

967
00:56:39,760 --> 00:56:41,480
We came last year, too.

968
00:56:42,760 --> 00:56:44,880
He saved Mom's life.

969
00:56:50,960 --> 00:56:52,240
Yiran!

970
00:56:52,240 --> 00:56:54,200
Yiran!

971
00:56:58,000 --> 00:56:59,280
Without him,

972
00:57:00,560 --> 00:57:01,960
Liangliang wouldn't be here.

973
00:57:06,200 --> 00:57:08,200
Thank you for saving my mom.

974
00:57:08,880 --> 00:57:11,440
I carved these by hand. They're all for you.

975
00:57:18,840 --> 00:57:19,560
Let's go.

976
00:57:30,120 --> 00:57:31,360
Unbelievable.

977
00:57:32,080 --> 00:57:33,920
Forcing me to dress like this.

978
00:57:34,160 --> 00:57:36,640
Dad would jump out of his grave if he saw this.

979
00:57:37,880 --> 00:57:39,240
Good if he does.

980
00:57:39,760 --> 00:57:40,800
Let him see

981
00:57:40,800 --> 00:57:42,200
how pretty we both look,

982
00:57:42,560 --> 00:57:44,040
how glamorous we're dressed,

983
00:57:44,200 --> 00:57:45,600
and how great our lives are.

984
00:57:46,360 --> 00:57:47,560
Great my ass.
